":[{"type":"text","value":"Bằng cách chỉ sử dụng instruction \"thô\" mà không có bất kỳ abstraction nào, đây là cách đúc token sẽ trông như thế nào:","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1,"offset":727},"end":{"line":15,"column":120,"offset":846}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1,"offset":727},"end":{"line":15,"column":120,"offset":846}}},{"type":"code","lang":"ts","meta":null,"value":"const destination = Keypair.generate();\r\n\r\nconst tokenAccount = await getAssociatedTokenAddress(\r\n    mint.publicKey,\r\n    destination.publicKey,\r\n);\r\n\r\n// Create ATA creation instruction\r\nconst createAtaInstruction = createAssociatedTokenAccountIdempotentInstruction(\r\n    keypair.publicKey, // payer\r\n    tokenAccount, // associated token account address\r\n    destination.publicKey, // owner\r\n    mint.publicKey, // mint\r\n);\r\n\r\n// Mint tokens to ATA \r\nconst mintToInstruction = createMintToInstruction(\r\n    mint.publicKey, // mint\r\n    tokenAccount, // destination\r\n    keypair.publicKey, // mint authority\r\n    1_000e6, // amount of tokens\r\n);\r\n\r\nconst transaction = new Transaction().add(\r\n    createAtaInstruction,\r\n    mintToInstruction,\r\n);\r\n\r\nconst signature = await sendAndConfirmTransaction(connection, transaction, [keypair]);\r\n\r\nconsole.log(`Token accounts created and tokens minted! Check out your TX here: https://explorer.solana.com/tx/${signature}?cluster=devnet`);","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1,"offset":850},"end":{"line":49,"column":4,"offset":1844}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-0"}},{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"ArticleSection","attributes":[{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"name","value":"Instruction được trừu tượng hóa","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":17,"offset":1864},"end":{"line":51,"column":55,"offset":1902}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"id","value":"abstracted-instruction","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":56,"offset":1903},"end":{"line":51,"column":83,"offset":1930}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"level","value":"h2","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":84,"offset":1931},"end":{"line":51,"column":94,"offset":1941}}}],"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1,"offset":1848},"end":{"line":51,"column":97,"offset":1944}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Đây là cách các instruction tương tự sẽ trông như thế nào được trừu tượng hóa với instruction ","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":1,"offset":1948},"end":{"line":53,"column":95,"offset":2042}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mintTo()","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":95,"offset":2042},"end":{"line":53,"column":105,"offset":2052}}},{"type":"text","value":":","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":105,"offset":2052},"end":{"line":53,"column":106,"offset":2053}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":1,"offset":1948},"end":{"line":53,"column":106,"offset":2053}}},{"type":"code","lang":"ts","meta":null,"value":"const destination = Keypair.generate();\r\n\r\nconst ata = await getOrCreateAssociatedTokenAccount(\r\n    connection,\r\n    keypair,\r\n    mint,\r\n    destination.publicKey\r\n);\r\n\r\nconsole.log(`This is your ATA: ${ata.address}!`)\r\n  \r\nlet tx = await mintTo(\r\n    connection,\r\n    keypair,\r\n    mint,\r\n    ata.address,\r\n    keypair.publicKey,\r\n    1e6,\r\n);\r\n\r\nconsole.log(`Succesfully Minted!. Transaction Here: https://explorer.solana.com/tx/${tx}?cluster=devnet`)","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1,"offset":2057},"end":{"line":77,"column":4,"offset":2524}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-1"}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":77,"column":4,"offset":2524}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# Instruction đúc token\r\n\r\nĐúc một lượng token mới và gửi chúng vào một account được chỉ định. Chỉ mint authority mới có thể thực hiện thao tác này.\r\n\r\nTrước khi chúng ta có thể đúc bất kỳ token nào, chúng ta sẽ cần phải có:\r\n- Account `Mint` đã khởi tạo mà chúng ta giữ `mintAuthority`\r\n- Account `Token` hoặc account `Associated Token` đã khởi tạo, nơi chúng ta sẽ đúc token đến\r\n\r\n> Số lượng token chúng ta đúc được \"chuẩn hóa\" với decimal. Điều này có nghĩa là nếu chúng ta muốn đúc 1 token có decimal là 6, chúng ta sẽ cần thực sự đặt `1e6` làm amount\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Instruction thô\" id=\"raw-instruction\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\nBằng cách chỉ sử dụng instruction \"thô\" mà không có bất kỳ abstraction nào, đây là cách đúc token sẽ trông như thế nào:\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nconst destination = Keypair.generate();\r\n\r\nconst tokenAccount = await getAssociatedTokenAddress(\r\n    mint.publicKey,\r\n    destination.publicKey,\r\n);\r\n\r\n// Create ATA creation instruction\r\nconst createAtaInstruction = createAssociatedTokenAccountIdempotentInstruction(\r\n    keypair.publicKey, // payer\r\n    tokenAccount, // associated token account address\r\n    destination.publicKey, // owner\r\n    mint.publicKey, // mint\r\n);\r\n\r\n// Mint tokens to ATA \r\nconst mintToInstruction = createMintToInstruction(\r\n    mint.publicKey, // mint\r\n    tokenAccount, // destination\r\n    keypair.publicKey, // mint authority\r\n    1_000e6, // amount of tokens\r\n);\r\n\r\nconst transaction = new Transaction().add(\r\n    createAtaInstruction,\r\n    mintToInstruction,\r\n);\r\n\r\nconst signature = await sendAndConfirmTransaction(connection, transaction, [keypair]);\r\n\r\nconsole.log(`Token accounts created and tokens minted! Check out your TX here: https://explorer.solana.com/tx/${signature}?cluster=devnet`);\r\n```\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Instruction được trừu tượng hóa\" id=\"abstracted-instruction\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\nĐây là cách các instruction tương tự sẽ trông như thế nào được trừu tượng hóa với instruction `mintTo()`:\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nconst destination = Keypair.generate();\r\n\r\nconst ata = await getOrCreateAssociatedTokenAccount(\r\n    connection,\r\n    keypair,\r\n    mint,\r\n    destination.publicKey\r\n);\r\n\r\nconsole.log(`This is your ATA: ${ata.address}!`)\r\n  \r\nlet tx = await mintTo(\r\n    connection,\r\n    keypair,\r\n    mint,\r\n    ata.address,\r\n    keypair.publicKey,\r\n    1e6,\r\n);\r\n\r\nconsole.log(`Succesfully Minted!. Transaction Here: https://explorer.solana.com/tx/${tx}?cluster=devnet`)\r\n```","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"ts","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"const"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" destination "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"="}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" Keypair."}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#62E884"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"generate"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"();"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"const"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" tokenAccount "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","p